5. Reflection: use choice_reflection after the perspective and mental-state analysis to compare the inferred SEEKER state against all listed choices.
6. Recommended tool sequence:
   1. shift_perspective {"characters": ["SEEKER"]}
   2. mental_state_analysis {"name": "SEEKER", "mental_states": "knowledge of previous recommendations, preference, belief about RECOMMENDER's closing, conversational intention, expectation/likely next strategy"}
